OL,3,GNEWSACouncil took four days to identify
OL,4,Acyber attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority took four days to
OL,7,Fidentify a cyber attack on the system
OL,8,Fit uses to manage the schools it runs.
OL,10,FBristol City Council said it first
OL,11,Fnoticed suspicious activity on the
OL,12,FTrading with Schools service on 21
OL,13,FSeptember but it was not shut down
OL,14,Funtil 25 September.
OL,16,FThe South West Regional Economic and
OL,17,FCyber Crime unit has confirmed that it
OL,18,Fis at the early stage of an
OL,19,Finvestigation into the hack which has
OL,20,Faffected 87 schools.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
