OL,3,GNEWSACouncil took four days to identify
OL,4,Acyber attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Tony Dyer confirmed the
OL,7,Fdiscovery of malicious software. He
OL,8,Fsaid the council's current analysis had
OL,9,F"not identified any evidence that data
OL,10,Fhas been stolen".
